{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2102844654169575547","id":"2102844654169575547","text":"I wanted to quickly create a short video with Opus 5.5 about the history of AI, from \"Attention is all you need\" to AGI.\n\nNo stock footage, no image or video generators: every frame is rendered from code.\n\n This 3-minute film was made 100% in code by Claude in Claude Code: ~7,400 lines of React/TypeScript (Remotion), every image drawn in SVG and Canvas, an open-source TTS voice, and a score synthesized in Python. No stock footage. No image generators.\n\nId say pretty cool! Tookl about 1h and 7% weekly rates.","raw_text":{"text":"I wanted to quickly create a short video with Opus 5.5 about the history of AI, from \"Attention is all you need\" to AGI.\n\nNo stock footage, no image or video generators: every frame is rendered from code.\n\n This 3-minute film was made 100% in code by Claude in Claude Code: ~7,400 lines of React/TypeScript (Remotion), every image drawn in SVG and Canvas, an open-source TTS voice, and a score synthesized in Python. No stock footage. No image generators.\n\nId say pretty cool! Tookl about 1h and 7% weekly rates.","display_text_range":[0,512],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[281,304],"id":"2102844491820670976","display":"pic.x.com/FSTZrJeFmw","original":"https://t.co/FSTZrJeFmw","replacement":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2102844654169575547/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"kimmonismus","url":"https://x.com/kimmonismus","id":"1573399256836309009","followers":147001,"following":3383,"likes":46934,"media_count":10259,"name":"Chubby♨️","description":"Tech Analyst & Content Creator. Editor-in-Chief @getsuperintel - Community of 300k+ in total: 🔗 https://linktr.ee/kimmonismus //📧 kim@getsuperintel.com","raw_description":{"text":"Tech Analyst & Content Creator. Editor-in-Chief @getsuperintel - Community of 300k+ in total: 🔗 https://t.co/jHMmImmI5I //📧 kim@getsuperintel.com","facets":[{"type":"url"